      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120718395901608078",
      "text": "Remarkably, the Golden Knights are getting a full two-minute 5v3. Utah commit two infractions. A hold and bench minor for too many men. Huge opportunity for #VGK",
