      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120717641971298337",
      "text": "A little flash there from Connelly. Late in a shift, Eichel hits him coming out of the zone, he gets around a defender, then nearly sets up Andersson back door.",
      "url": "https://x.com/RyanHockeyGuy/status/2120717641971298337",
      "published": "2026-11-12T03:17:41+00:00",
      "likes": 10,
      "author": "Ryan The Hockey Guy",
      "handle": "RyanHockeyGuy",
