      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2120715254619570494",
      "text": "Excellent penalty kill from Vegas. Utah was dangerous at the start, but once #VGK got a clear, they made it tough on Utah to get back in the zone.",
