      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2111544472022732800/4TCIFE2w_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "Lawson Crouse ties the game. After the fourth line iced the puck twice, Utah wins a faceoff. Andrew Peeke walks to the middle of the ice and throws a puck on net. It hits Theodore, and kicks out to Crouse. Tap-in. 1-1",
      "quoted_author": "Ryan The Hockey Guy",
      "quoted_handle": "RyanHockeyGuy"
    },
